  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>gpu-compaction-scatter · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-compaction-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-compaction-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">enable subgroups;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">requires subgroup_id;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">override ELEMENT_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"6\">override BLOCK_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">override INPUT_OFFSET: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"8\">override FLAGS_OFFSET: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">override OUTPUT_OFFSET: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">override COUNT_OFFSET: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">override DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">override DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"13\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputValues: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; flags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"15\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputCount: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; subgroupTotals: array&lt;u32, 64&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"19\">@compute @workgroup_size(256) fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  @builtin(subgroup_invocation_id) subgroupInvocationId: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  @builtin(subgroup_size) subgroupSize: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  @builtin(subgroup_id) subgroupId: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let lane = subgroupId * subgroupSize + subgroupInvocationId;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * DISPATCH_X + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= BLOCK_COUNT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  let firstRow = workgroupIndex * 1024u + lane * 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  var rowFlags: array&lt;u32, 4&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  var rowValues: array&lt;u32, 4&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  var rowCount = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  for (var item = 0u; item &lt; 4u; item++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    if (firstRow + item &lt; ELEMENT_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">      let flag = min(flags[FLAGS_OFFSET + firstRow + item], 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">      rowFlags[item] = flag;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">      rowCount += flag;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">      if (flag != 0u) { rowValues[item] = inputValues[INPUT_OFFSET + firstRow + item]; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  let subgroupPrefix = subgroupExclusiveAdd(rowCount);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  let subgroupTotal = subgroupAdd(rowCount);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  if (subgroupInvocationId == 0u) { subgroupTotals[subgroupId] = subgroupTotal; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    var runningTotal = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    for (var subgroupIndex = 0u; subgroupIndex &lt; 256u / subgroupSize; subgroupIndex++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">      let total = subgroupTotals[subgroupIndex];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">      subgroupTotals[subgroupIndex] = runningTotal;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">      runningTotal += total;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">    outputCount[COUNT_OFFSET] = runningTotal;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let rowPrefix = subgroupTotals[subgroupId] + subgroupPrefix;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  var outputIndex = rowPrefix;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  for (var item = 0u; item &lt; 4u; item++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">    if (rowFlags[item] != 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">      outputValues[OUTPUT_OFFSET + outputIndex] = rowValues[item];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">      outputIndex += 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>inputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"stationRows\">stationRows</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>flags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"wet\">wet</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"wetStations\">wetStations</td><td>write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>outputCount<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"wetCount\">wetCount</td><td>write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUCompaction/block-scatter/subgroups · main · 7d4355eb</figcaption></figure></section>",
